Error: Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed: `b` cannot be assigned while `result` is still looking into it
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/undeclared_view_callback_freezes_every_non_scalar_argument.jet:14:5
    |
 14 |     b = "mutated"
    |     ^
 Why: `result` is a live read view into `b`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `result` before changing `b`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed
